<!--Bootstrap: "mb-4" adds spacing below heading, "text-heading centers"-->
<h1 class="mb-4 text-center">My Projects</h1>

<!--Bootstrap flexbox: "d-flex" places cards in a row, "fex-wrap" moves them to the next line when out of space-->
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap">
    <!--Project card (structure from Bootstrap, see README): "card" is the box, "card-body" is the content-->
    <div class="card" style="max-width: 320px;">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h4 class="card-title">TriviaTime - Python Quiz Game</h4>
        <p class="card-text">For my final project in INFR1101 - Intro to Python, I created an interactive quiz game using Python fundamentals.</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    <!--The next three cards use the same Bootstrap structure-->
    <div class="card" style="max-width: 320px;">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h4 class="card-title">History of the Smartphone - Paper</h4>
        <p class="card-text">The culminating essay for my History of Science and Technology course covered the history of the smartphone and the developments that made it possible.</p>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="max-width: 320px;">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h4 class="card-title">Understanding Selfhood Through Literature - Essay</h4>
        <p class="card-text">For the final essay in my Reading Our World course, I analyzed how literary works reflect and shape our understanding of selfhood and identity.</p>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="max-width: 320px;">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h4 class="card-title">Leadership in Fiction- Group Presentation</h4>
